# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD A PREMIUM, FULLY FUNCTIONAL GYM & FITNESS CLUB WEBSITE

Act as a world-class UI/UX designer, fitness-industry consultant, senior full-stack engineer, backend architect, SEO specialist, and conversion-rate optimization expert.

Your task is to research, design, and build a complete, production-ready, visually stunning Gym & Fitness Center website. This must be a real, multi-page, fully connected web application—not merely a landing page, static template, or collection of non-functional UI screens.

The website should be suitable for a premium fitness brand serving customers in India and internationally. It must look professional enough to demonstrate to prospective gym owners as a client-ready project.

Use the working brand name **VOLT FITNESS CLUB**. Create a distinctive visual identity, an original logo, compelling fitness imagery, realistic sample content, functional membership purchasing flows, secure backend functionality, and a polished admin dashboard.

Do not stop after generating a homepage. Build the complete application, connect every page, implement the core user journeys, test the result, and provide clear setup instructions.

